fmaReg 33 30 32 27
fmaReg 30 33 29 30
fmaReg 33 31 32 28
fmaReg 31 33 29 31
note Restore signed zero after the FMA correction.
inst 18 30 30 Z Z 0x7fffffff
inst 18 31 31 Z Z 0x7fffffff
inst 18 33 27 Z Z 0x80000000
iadd 30 30 33
inst 18 33 28 Z Z 0x80000000
iadd 31 31 33
end
if fp4
inst 66 32 31 30 Z 0
