else
inst 65 32 31 30 Z 0
inst 9 16 26 Z 4 1
inst 68 Z 16 32 Z 0
inst 18 34 32 Z Z 255
inst 17 35 32 Z Z 8
inst 18 35 35 Z Z 255
readAt 34 2 34 0
readAt 35 2 35 0
end
fop 32 34 34 25
fop 32 35 35 25
inst 61 34 35 34 Z 0
inst 18 35 34 Z Z 0xffff0000
mad 34 34 65536 Z
