note One thread per token. Keep six largest (sqrt(softplus(logit))+bias) and their raw scores.
fn route to void
start 4
mad 20 15 384 Z
mad 21 15 6 Z
for k ulong 6
literal add 32 k 0xff800000
literal add 38 k 0
number add 44 k 0.0f32
end
literal 22 0
literal 23 384
