note Widen the BF16 vocabulary row and replicate it into four initial residual streams.
fn tokenEmbed to void
start 3
parameter 20 24
parameter 21 28
mad 22 15 128 14
readAt 23 0 18 0
literal 24 0xffffffff
madreg 24 20 24 23
inst 28 Z 24 21 Z 0
inst 9 56 24 Z 2 10240
inst 17 25 22 Z Z 1
inst 9 16 25 Z 56 4
literal 26 0
put dsGuard 0 2
inst 11 26 16 Z Z 0
inst 18 25 22 Z Z 1
literal 24 1
inst 28 Z 25 24 Z 0
put dsGuard 0 2
mad 26 26 65536 Z
inst 18 26 26 Z Z 0xffff0000
mad 23 18 20480 22
for j ulong 4
writeAt 26 4 23 mul j 20480
end
end
note Assemble six routed down projections plus the shared expert. Routing weights were applied before w2.
fn moeSum to void
start 3
mad 20 15 128 14
mad 21 18 30720 20
mad 22 18 5120 20
number 23 0.0f32
for j ulong 6
readAt 24 0 21 mul j 20480
fop 30 23 23 24
end
readAt 24 2 22 0
